From: kexec diagnostics <local>
Subject: [DIAG] arm64: bounded opt-in user fault and task metadata

Parent: shutdown-log-quiet 87bae5a7. Diagnostic only; no additional
user VA or file-content reads. Event absence and handled SIGILL do not
prove fatality, hardware state or task progress.

